### Coleção de testes — Clyvo Vet API (/api/v1)
### Use um cliente REST compatível com .http (IntelliJ HTTP Client, VS Code REST Client)
### ou copie os curls equivalentes.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = COLE_AQUI_UM_ID_TOKEN_DO_FIREBASE

### 1. Sem token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets

### 2. Lista vazia -> 200 []
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets?tutorId=qualquer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Criar pet -> 201 com id
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": "sera-ignorado",
  "nome": "Thor",
  "especie": "cachorro",
  "raca": "Golden Retriever",
  "sexo": "Macho",
  "dataNascimento": "2022-03-15",
  "peso": "28.4",
  "castrado": true,
  "foto": "",
  "observacoes": "Alérgico a frango"
}

### 4. Buscar pet por id -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Pet inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Atualizar pet -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": "sera-ignorado",
  "nome": "Thor",
  "especie": "cachorro",
  "raca": "Golden Retriever",
  "sexo": "Macho",
  "dataNascimento": "2022-03-15",
  "peso": "29.1",
  "castrado": true,
  "foto": "",
  "observacoes": "Alérgico a frango; peso atualizado"
}

### 7. Validação -> 400 com campo "nome"
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "",
  "especie": "cachorro",
  "sexo": "Macho"
}

### 8. Criar consulta -> 201 (petId como string)
POST {{baseUrl}}/consultas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": "sera-ignorado",
  "petId": "1",
  "petNome": "",
  "data": "2026-09-24",
  "horario": "14:30",
  "clinica": "Clyvo Vet — Unidade Paulista",
  "veterinario": "Dra. Marina Alves",
  "motivo": "Vacinação anual",
  "status": "agendada",
  "observacoes": ""
}

### 9. Consulta com pet de outro tutor -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/consultas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "petId": "999999",
  "data": "2026-09-24",
  "horario": "14:30",
  "clinica": "Clyvo Vet",
  "motivo": "Teste de acesso negado"
}

### 10. Listar consultas -> 200 []
GET {{baseUrl}}/consultas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Excluir pet -> 204 sem corpo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
